Subject: Preserve original target registry with native lifetime and failure checks
Upstream-base: bab83befb5d6a2fdff0b30d2ec4b59f7251a108d

Keep original target naming, lookup and registration. Native platform targets
own independent resource pools and Aurora copy-texture lifetimes. Use fixed-width
Wii descriptions, reject invalid/aliased handles after reuse and roll back failed
texture registration. Add ordered shutdown and matching frees for game-allocated
registry nodes. The desktop adapter supplies GX calls and native texture records.

